        "jsCode": "// Runs once for all items — the collapse is intentional (batch summary).\n// Count from Load pending, NOT from the sub-workflow output: APPT 20 ends on the\n// High fit? false branch for sub-60 listings, which emits no item, so Replay via\n// Ingest can return nothing (alwaysOutputData keeps this node running anyway).\nreturn [{ json: { replayed: $('Load pending').all().filter(i => i.json && i.json.id).length } }];"
